      "description": "<p>When you successfully hit one or more targets with an attack, you may spend 2 Inventory Points to produce a special <strong>infusion</strong> and apply the corresponding effect to that attack <em>(if the attack had the </em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.Gm3upxgpUVoLSK5u\" data-id=\"Gm3upxgpUVoLSK5u\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\" aria-describedby=\"tooltip\" style=\"cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; white-space: nowrap; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(25, 24, 19); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; font-size: 14px;\"><em><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Multi</span></strong></em></a></span></span><em> property, apply the effects of the infusion to each target).</em></p>\n\n<p>You cannot apply more than one infusion to the same attack; producing and using an infusion are both part of the action you used to attack with the weapon.</p>\n\n<details class=\"potion-foldout\">\n  <summary>Advanced Infusion Table</summary>\n  <table class=\"book-table\">\n    <caption>ADVANCED INFUSIONS</caption>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th style=\"width:140px;\">INFUSION</th>\n        <th>EFFECT</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <th scope=\"row\">Cyclone</th>\n        <td>The attack deals 5 extra damage, and its damage becomes <em><strong>air</strong></em>.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <th scope=\"row\">Exorcism</th>\n        <td>The attack deals 5 extra damage, and its damage becomes <em><strong>light</strong></em>.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <th scope=\"row\">Seismic</th>\n        <td>The attack deals 5 extra damage, and its damage becomes <em><strong>earth</strong></em>.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <th scope=\"row\">Shadow</th>\n        <td>The attack deals 5 extra damage, and its damage becomes <em><strong>dark</strong></em>.</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</details>\n\n<style>\n/* Infusion Table Styles */\n.potion-foldout { border: 1px solid #d3d7cf; border-radius: 8px; background: #f9faf9; }\n.potion-foldout > summary {\n  cursor: pointer; padding:.6rem .8rem; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.02em;\n  background:#254a41; color:#fff; border-radius:7px 7px 0 0; user-select:none;\n}\n.book-table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:.6rem 0 1rem; }\n.book-table caption {\n  text-align:left; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.06em; color:#254a41;\n  padding:.35rem .5rem; text-transform:uppercase;\n}\n.book-table thead th {\n  background:#254a41; color:#fff; font-weight:700; padding:.45rem .6rem;\n  border-top:1px solid #254a41;\n}\n.book-table tbody td, .book-table tbody th {\n  padding:.4rem .6rem; vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #e6e9e6; background:#fff;\n}\n.book-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) td { background:#f3f7f3; }\n.book-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) th[scope=\"row\"] { background:#f3f7f3; }\n</style>\n",
